$language["For general inquiries or questions about our services, please email us at contact@omniversedynamics.com or call us at +88+1 555 123 4567"]="For general inquiries or questions about our services, please email us at contact@omniversedynamics.com or call us at +88+1 555 123 4567";
$language["Customer Support"]="Customer Support";
$language["If you need assistance with our products or services, our dedicated customer support team is here to help. You can reach them via email at support@omniversedynamics.com or by phone at +88+1 555 123 4567."]="If you need assistance with our products or services, our dedicated customer support team is here to help. You can reach them via email at support@omniversedynamics.com or by phone at +88+1 555 123 4567.";
