$language["We believe in providing flexible and affordable solutions to meet your needs. Our pricing plans are designed to offer value and functionality, ensuring that you get the most out of our services without breaking the bank. Whether you re a small startup or a large enterprise, we have a plan tailored just for you. Explore our pricing options below and choose the one that best fits your requirements"]="We believe in providing flexible and affordable solutions to meet your needs. Our pricing plans are designed to offer value and functionality, ensuring that you get the most out of our services without breaking the bank. Whether you re a small startup or a large enterprise, we have a plan tailored just for you. Explore our pricing options below and choose the one that best fits your requirements";
