$language["The Regular Plan provides comprehensive contact, financial, vehicle, and trip management features. Its ideal for small to medium-sized businesses seeking enhanced operational control and efficiency."]="The Regular Plan provides comprehensive contact, financial, vehicle, and trip management features. Its ideal for small to medium-sized businesses seeking enhanced operational control and efficiency.";
